{"seq":1,"slug":"ssr-fundamentals","title":"SSR 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/server-rendering/ssr-fundamentals","wordCount":748,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"ssr-基础\">SSR 基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>服务端渲染（SSR）在服务器上把 React 组件渲染成 HTML 字符串，发送给浏览器后再通过水合（Hydration）把静态 HTML 变成可交互的应用。它换来更快的首屏与更好的 SEO，代价是更高的服务器负载与水合成本。本章讲解 SSR 的收益与成本、<code>renderToString</code> 与流式 API 的差异、水合与水合不匹配的排查、流式 SSR，以及选择性水合如何提升可交互时间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是服务端渲染\">什么是服务端渲染</h2><p><strong>服务端渲染（Server-Side Rendering, SSR）</strong> 是在服务器上将 React 组件渲染为 HTML 字符串，发送给浏览器后再通过 <strong>水合（Hydration）</strong> 将静态 HTML 转换为可交互的 React 应用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph CSR[&quot;客户端渲染 (CSR)&quot;]&#10;        A1[请求页面] --&gt; A2[返回空 HTML + JS]&#10;        A2 --&gt; A3[下载 JS Bundle]&#10;        A3 --&gt; A4[执行 JS 渲染 DOM]&#10;        A4 --&gt; A5[可见且可交互]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph SSR[&quot;服务端渲染 (SSR)&quot;]&#10;        B1[请求页面] --&gt; B2[服务器渲染 HTML]&#10;        B2 --&gt; B3[返回完整 HTML]&#10;        B3 --&gt; B4[可见但不可交互]&#10;        B4 --&gt; B5[下载 JS + 水合]&#10;        B5 --&gt; B6[可见且可交互]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph CSR[\"客户端渲染 (CSR)\"]\n        A1[请求页面] --&gt; A2[返回空 HTML + JS]\n        A2 --&gt; A3[下载 JS Bundle]\n        A3 --&gt; A4[执行 JS 渲染 DOM]\n        A4 --&gt; A5[可见且可交互]\n    end\n    subgraph SSR[\"服务端渲染 (SSR)\"]\n        B1[请求页面] --&gt; B2[服务器渲染 HTML]\n        B2 --&gt; B3[返回完整 HTML]\n        B3 --&gt; B4[可见但不可交互]\n        B4 --&gt; B5[下载 JS + 水合]\n        B5 --&gt; B6[可见且可交互]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>CSR</th>\n<th>SSR</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FCP（首次内容绘制）</td>\n<td>慢（等待 JS）</td>\n<td>快（HTML 直出）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TTI（可交互时间）</td>\n<td>FCP ≈ TTI</td>\n<td>FCP &lt; TTI（水合延迟）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SEO</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务器负载</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TTFB</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>较慢（需要渲染）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"rendertostring\">renderToString</h2><p><code>renderToString</code> 是最基础的 SSR API，将 React 元素同步渲染为 HTML 字符串：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { renderToString } from &#39;react-dom/server&#39;;&#10;import express from &#39;express&#39;;&#10;&#10;const app = express();&#10;&#10;app.get(&#39;*&#39;, (req, res) =&gt; {&#10;  const html = renderToString(&lt;App url={req.url} /&gt;);&#10;&#10;  res.send(`&#10;    &lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#10;    &lt;html&gt;&#10;      &lt;head&gt;&#10;        &lt;title&gt;React SSR&lt;/title&gt;&#10;      &lt;/head&gt;&#10;      &lt;body&gt;&#10;        &lt;div id=&quot;root&quot;&gt;${html}&lt;/div&gt;&#10;        &lt;script src=&quot;/bundle.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;      &lt;/body&gt;&#10;    &lt;/html&gt;&#10;  `);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { renderToString } from 'react-dom/server';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import express from 'express';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const app = express();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.get('*', (req, res) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const html = renderToString(&#x3C;App url={req.url} />);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  res.send(`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;!DOCTYPE html></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;html></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;head></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;title>React SSR&#x3C;/title></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/head></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;body></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div id=\"root\">${html}&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;script src=\"/bundle.js\">&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/body></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/html></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  `);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>renderToString</code> 是同步阻塞的，对于大型页面会阻塞 Node.js 事件循环。React 18 推荐使用 <code>renderToPipeableStream</code> 替代。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"hydration-水合\">Hydration 水合</h2><p>水合是在客户端将静态 HTML&quot;激活&quot;为可交互应用的过程。React 不会重新创建 DOM，而是复用服务端生成的 DOM 节点，仅绑定事件处理器和建立内部数据结构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { hydrateRoot } from &#39;react-dom/client&#39;;&#10;&#10;hydrateRoot(document.getElementById(&#39;root&#39;)!, &lt;App /&gt;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { hydrateRoot } from 'react-dom/client';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hydrateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!, &#x3C;App />);</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Server as 服务器&#10;    participant Browser as 浏览器&#10;    participant React as React&#10;&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Browser: 返回 HTML(含完整 DOM)&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;Browser: 显示静态页面(FCP)&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;Browser: 下载 JS Bundle&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;React: hydrateRoot()&#10;    React-&gt;&gt;React: 遍历组件树&#10;    React-&gt;&gt;Browser: 对比 DOM + 绑定事件&#10;    Note over Browser: 可交互(TTI)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Server as 服务器\n    participant Browser as 浏览器\n    participant React as React\n\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Browser: 返回 HTML(含完整 DOM)\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;Browser: 显示静态页面(FCP)\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;Browser: 下载 JS Bundle\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;React: hydrateRoot()\n    React-&gt;&gt;React: 遍历组件树\n    React-&gt;&gt;Browser: 对比 DOM + 绑定事件\n    Note over Browser: 可交互(TTI)</pre><h3 id=\"水合不匹配\">水合不匹配</h3><p>如果服务端和客户端渲染的 HTML 不一致，React 会发出警告。常见原因包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间相关代码</td>\n<td><code>new Date().toLocaleString()</code></td>\n<td>统一时区或延迟渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器 API</td>\n<td><code>window.innerWidth</code></td>\n<td>使用 <code>useEffect</code> 延迟获取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机值</td>\n<td><code>Math.random()</code></td>\n<td>使用固定 seed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件渲染差异</td>\n<td>基于 <code>typeof window</code></td>\n<td><code>suppressHydrationWarning</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function ClientOnly({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  const [mounted, setMounted] = useState(false);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    setMounted(true);&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  if (!mounted) return null;&#10;  return &lt;&gt;{children}&lt;/&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;Header /&gt;&#10;      &lt;ClientOnly&gt;&#10;        &lt;BrowserOnlyWidget /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/ClientOnly&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function ClientOnly({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [mounted, setMounted] = useState(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setMounted(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (!mounted) return null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;>{children}&#x3C;/>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Header /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;ClientOnly></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;BrowserOnlyWidget /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/ClientOnly></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"streaming-ssr\">Streaming SSR</h2><p>React 18 引入了流式 SSR，使用 <code>renderToPipeableStream</code> 逐步发送 HTML，不必等待整个页面渲染完成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { renderToPipeableStream } from &#39;react-dom/server&#39;;&#10;&#10;app.get(&#39;*&#39;, (req, res) =&gt; {&#10;  const { pipe, abort } = renderToPipeableStream(&lt;App url={req.url} /&gt;, {&#10;    bootstrapScripts: [&#39;/bundle.js&#39;],&#10;    onShellReady() {&#10;      res.statusCode = 200;&#10;      res.setHeader(&#39;Content-Type&#39;, &#39;text/html&#39;);&#10;      pipe(res);&#10;    },&#10;    onShellError(error) {&#10;      res.statusCode = 500;&#10;      res.send(&#39;&lt;h1&gt;服务器错误&lt;/h1&gt;&#39;);&#10;    },&#10;    onError(error) {&#10;      console.error(error);&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  setTimeout(() =&gt; abort(), 10000);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { renderToPipeableStream } from 'react-dom/server';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.get('*', (req, res) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { pipe, abort } = renderToPipeableStream(&#x3C;App url={req.url} />, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bootstrapScripts: ['/bundle.js'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onShellReady() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      res.statusCode = 200;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      res.setHeader('Content-Type', 'text/html');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      pipe(res);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onShellError(error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      res.statusCode = 500;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      res.send('&#x3C;h1>服务器错误&#x3C;/h1>');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onError(error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      console.error(error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setTimeout(() => abort(), 10000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[请求到达] --&gt; B[&quot;renderToPipeableStream&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Shell 渲染完成]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;onShellReady → 开始发送 HTML&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[浏览器开始渲染 Shell]&#10;    D --&gt; F[服务器继续渲染 Suspense 内容]&#10;    F --&gt; G[Suspense 内容就绪]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;发送 &lt;script&gt; 插入延迟内容&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[浏览器替换 fallback]\">flowchart TD\n    A[请求到达] --&gt; B[\"renderToPipeableStream\"]\n    B --&gt; C[Shell 渲染完成]\n    C --&gt; D[\"onShellReady → 开始发送 HTML\"]\n    D --&gt; E[浏览器开始渲染 Shell]\n    D --&gt; F[服务器继续渲染 Suspense 内容]\n    F --&gt; G[Suspense 内容就绪]\n    G --&gt; H[\"发送 &lt;script&gt; 插入延迟内容\"]\n    H --&gt; I[浏览器替换 fallback]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>同步/异步</th>\n<th>Suspense 支持</th>\n<th>流式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>renderToString</code></td>\n<td>同步</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>renderToPipeableStream</code></td>\n<td>异步</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅（Node.js）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>renderToReadableStream</code></td>\n<td>异步</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅（Web Stream）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"selective-hydration\">Selective Hydration</h2><p>选择性水合是 React 18 的重要特性。配合 Suspense，React 可以在部分内容尚未下载完成时就开始水合其他部分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;Header /&gt;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;SidebarSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;Sidebar /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;ContentSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;MainContent /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;CommentsSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;Comments /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Header /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;SidebarSkeleton />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Sidebar /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;ContentSkeleton />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;MainContent /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;CommentsSkeleton />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Comments /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>水合过程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>Header</code> 最先水合（不在 Suspense 中）</li>\n<li><code>Sidebar</code>、<code>MainContent</code>、<code>Comments</code> 并行加载代码</li>\n<li>哪个先加载完就先水合哪个</li>\n<li>如果用户点击了某个区域，React 会优先水合该区域</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[HTML 到达] --&gt; B[Header 水合]&#10;    B --&gt; C{用户点击了哪里?}&#10;    C --&gt;|Sidebar| D[优先水合 Sidebar]&#10;    C --&gt;|Content| E[优先水合 Content]&#10;    C --&gt;|无交互| F[按顺序水合]\">flowchart LR\n    A[HTML 到达] --&gt; B[Header 水合]\n    B --&gt; C{用户点击了哪里?}\n    C --&gt;|Sidebar| D[优先水合 Sidebar]\n    C --&gt;|Content| E[优先水合 Content]\n    C --&gt;|无交互| F[按顺序水合]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 选择性水合使得大型应用的 TTI 大幅提升——用户点击的区域会被优先水合，无需等待整个页面水合完成。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>SSR</strong> 在服务器上渲染 HTML，提升首屏速度和 SEO，但增加服务器负载和水合成本</li>\n<li><code>renderToString</code> 是同步 API，<code>renderToPipeableStream</code> 是异步流式 API（推荐）</li>\n<li><strong>水合</strong> 复用服务端 DOM 并绑定事件，服务端和客户端渲染结果必须一致</li>\n<li><strong>流式 SSR</strong> 配合 Suspense 逐步发送 HTML，浏览器可以更早开始渲染</li>\n<li><strong>选择性水合</strong> 允许 React 优先水合用户正在交互的区域，显著提升 TTI</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SSR 基础","id":"ssr-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是服务端渲染","id":"什么是服务端渲染"},{"level":2,"text":"renderToString","id":"rendertostring"},{"level":2,"text":"Hydration 水合","id":"hydration-水合"},{"level":3,"text":"水合不匹配","id":"水合不匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"Streaming SSR","id":"streaming-ssr"},{"level":2,"text":"Selective Hydration","id":"selective-hydration"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"错误边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/patterns-and-composition/error-boundaries"},"next":{"title":"React Server Components 服务端组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/server-rendering/react-server-components"}}